#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ca_cca.field_l10n_ca_cca_schedule_line__method
msgid ""
"Declining balance applies the rate parameter to the undepreciated capital "
"cost. Straight-line (classes 13 and 14) spreads the capital cost of each "
"asset over its life. Full write-off is the declining balance at a 100% rate "
"(class 12)."
msgstr ""
